WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Locate: Inspect the Marketplace listings tab.
The workspace shows the owner’s apps.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.100
Search: Filter the list by name.
The search narrows the actual visible listings.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.500
Restore: Clear the filter without changing a listing.
No edit or save occurs in this recording.
